/* Fermix product copy.
 *
 * The whole copy deck, externalized. Nothing user-visible is written in a
 * Swift literal; `ProductStringKey` is the only way in, and
 * `ProductStringsTests` gates both directions so a key without copy and copy
 * without a key both fail the build.
 *
 * Rules (enforced by ProductCopyRules): sentence case, no em dashes, no
 * exclamation marks, no "please wait", no placeholder copy, no FermixPet
 * naming. The daemon is "the Fermix daemon" once per screen and "the daemon"
 * afterwards. Errors read: what happened, what is untouched, one next action.
 */

